# .gitignore — Git ignore backstop for MANIFEST.json exclusions (D-07/D-08/D-10/D-14/D-15)
#
# Second layer ONLY: the primary structural denylist lives in MANIFEST.json
# (`excludes` per entry) and is consumed by capture (Phase 2). These rules stop
# ordinary `git add` of untracked sensitive/generated paths.
#
# Recursive `**/` patterns below cover every managed root mirrored under home/.
# Package manifests and lockfiles stay versioned (`npm ci` rebuilds modules).

# --- secrets & credentials (never versioned) ---
**/jev.env
**/.git-credentials
**/.claude.json
*.env
*.pem
*.key
**/BEGIN *PRIVATE KEY*
**/*token*
**/*secret*

# --- tracked source whose name merely contains "secret" (not a secret) ---
# The broad **/*secret* guard above would otherwise hide the shared detector
# library and its regression suite; re-include these exact paths only.
!lib/secret-scan.sh
!tests/pre-commit-secret.sh

# --- generated / reinstallable (rebuilt by `npm ci`) ---
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
dist/
build/

# --- archives & backup leftovers (never versioned) ---
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.tar
**/*.zip
**/*.bak*
**/*.bak-*
**/*.backup-*
*.backup
**/*.backup
**/opencode-backup/
**/opencode-backup-*.tar.gz
**/agents.bak-*
*backup-*
legacy-archive/
.opencode-ecosystem-backup/

# --- nested Git metadata (never versioned under home/) ---
**/.git/

# --- machine-local (never overwritten by restore, never committed) ---
**/*.local
home/.azure

# --- machine-local runtime data (backstop for MANIFEST excludes) ---
# context-mode session stores and any SQLite database/sidecar are runtime state,
# not managed config; the matching MANIFEST.json excludes drive capture/restore.
**/sessions/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/gsd-router.backup/
**/gsd-router/backup-*

# --- GSD ephemeral ---
.planning/.gsd-state-tmp/

# --- local Graphify layer (optional, regenerated by gsd-graphify-sync) ---
# The GSD-native store under .planning/graphs/ IS versioned; the local
# graphify-out/ layer is machine state (5MB+ of derived JSON).
graphify-out/
